Z||000006||deceler8||05-11-2001||10:14 AM||||Did you try spraying some clear over the "aluminum" paint ?<P>I paint stuff all the time with Krylon "gold" (not car parts) and it looks too "powdery" unless I go over it with a few coats of clear. The clear gives it a shine and a "richness" that the paint alone doesn't have.||||reg||1
